Sigzil Haight, the Shackled Prince, is a child of the [[Judge of Ages|Judge]] and a fiendish prince. His demesne is somewhere far out along the [[Infinite Horizon]].

His followers carry the smell of copper and brimstone. On the [[Geography/Star 221,325|Joker World at Star 221,325]], his servants hold [[Geography/The Quorum|the Quorum]], a structure reached only by answering its door. Among them are a mage and an enforcer, and a horde of [[Hellion|Hellions]]; [[Flintlock Toboggan]] is chained in one of its rooms. A fountain of blood in the Quorum's hall leads into the prince's demesne beyond.

He made the [[Voice of Many]], a [[Hearts|Heart]], and kept it sealed in his demesne for centuries. It has since been freed and serves the Scale. The [[Keeper of Chains]] is one of his generals.
